# Name values

Follow the project skill `.agents/skills/add-name-value/SKILL.md`. Design notes: `docs/structured-name-model.md`.

- Types, `Validate` and the part-type registry live in `core/namevalue`; use `namevalues.Insert` / `Lookup` for storage; required `form`; optional ordered parts.
- Part `type` empty or a product registry key (`PartTypes` / `KnownPartType`); `Validate` (and Insert) rejects unknown keys. No free-text types in UI.
- Do not close `type` in DDL; user-minted part-type tables are a later PR.
- Schema changes go through catalog migrations; do not invent a parallel name store.
- Format profiles (`name_format_*`) are separate — not this package.
